{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"main_base_l5","model_identifier":"main_base_l5","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# main_base_l5\n\nMain base level 5, Marble Hall (the first marble level): marble ground floor, porch and window sills, timber-framed upper storey, slate roof, stone chimneys.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -112..112, y 0..217, z -112..112 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 207, construction_0 31, construction_33 81, construction_66 106, ruined 46 (8 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 176 x 200 x 120 (w x h x d) centred at x 0, z 4\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `main_base_l5_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `main_base_l5_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_main_base_l5` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -57)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-50, 218, 4)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (50, 218, 4)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (50, 0, -62)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"hall_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-82.0,0.0,-50.0],"to":[82.0,3.0,58.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,842.0,164.0,845.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,851.0,108.0,854.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,842.0,164.0,845.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,851.0,108.0,854.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28.0,0.0,192.0,108.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[28.0,0.0,192.0,108.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"77753404-0250-5faf-a77e-cde14a81cd6a"},{"name":"hall_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-80.0,3.0,-48.0],"to":[80.0,89.0,-44.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,227.0,160.0,313.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,313.0,4.0,399.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,227.0,160.0,313.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,313.0,4.0,399.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[38.0,799.0,198.0,803.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[38.0,799.0,198.0,803.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"90494fa2-7f2b-5fa3-9479-99997b11769d"},{"name":"hall_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-80.0,3.0,52.0],"to":[80.0,89.0,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,227.0,160.0,313.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.0,313.0,8.0,399.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,227.0,160.0,313.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.0,313.0,8.0,399.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,804.0,160.0,808.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,804.0,160.0,808.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"680ab233-b49c-587a-b68e-ec5fca6633f7